# Atlas case 5 — Solana / Loopscale (Anchor / Cargo).
#
# These are the case-local patterns; the top-level
# experiments/invariant-atlas/.gitignore covers them too. The local
# copy makes the case dir self-contained and lets a contributor work
# inside cases/05-solana-loopscale/ without leaning on the parent.

# Cargo build output for both twins.
clean/target/
planted/target/
clean/programs/loopscale_market/target/
planted/programs/loopscale_market/target/

# Cargo.lock — kept off-tree. The pinned anchor-lang / rustc
# versions in programs/loopscale_market/Cargo.toml are the
# reproducibility surface; a committed Cargo.lock fights the pinned
# toolchain on a dep refresh.
clean/Cargo.lock
planted/Cargo.lock

# proptest persists minimal-failing-input regression files alongside
# the test source. Those are reproducible from the proptest seed and
# the source, so they stay off-tree.
**/*.proptest-regressions

# OS junk.
.DS_Store
